      "writtenOn": "2022-09-22T11:20:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Cole: it\u0027s to keep potential differences small. Until we have plans to import rules_go (or write our own go rules), I agree that we should keep bazel and soong in sync.\n\nThis is an improvement over directly referencing the prebuilt because bp2build can now emit BUILD files that contain a dep to //build/soong/zip/cmd:soong_zip even though we\u0027re not converting the soong_zip module.\n\nFiled b/248222296 and elaborated in the commit.",
      "parentUuid": "84717875_f214a165",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 58
      },
      "revId": "d7d1a0482168340217162a6cd6fd8fc982e16f41",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0271d51e_cf3d6fa9",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 11,
      "author": {
        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-22T16:43:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should do both the alias change and make soong use prebuilts. This alias change is to make bazel act like it\u0027s using the source version, so then making soong use the prebuilt version will make people wonder why bazel doesn\u0027t just directly use the prebuilt version as well.",
      "parentUuid": "fd39c1e2_6dd695b1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 58
      },
      "revId": "d7d1a0482168340217162a6cd6fd8fc982e16f41",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3793d05c_09729a02",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 11,
      "author": {
        "id": 1687194
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-22T17:00:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are two use cases of tools like soong_zip:\n\n1. Soong-written ninja actions\n2. Users specifying the tool in genrule/gensrcs\n\n\nUsing the prebuilt in #1 helps us ensure that the prebuilt gets updated if Soong itself needs to rely on new features.\n\nThe alias allows us to build Bazel targets like #2 before migrating these targets",
      "parentUuid": "0271d51e_cf3d6fa9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 58
      },
      "revId": "d7d1a0482168340217162a6cd6fd8fc982e16f41",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
